00:23:07,620 --> 00:23:12,300
When these side effects occur, they are called adverse reactions.

261
00:23:13,320 --> 00:23:18,400
Whenever you have an adverse reaction, you should stop taking the drug right away.

262
00:23:19,060 --> 00:23:23,640
Ask your pharmacist whether he can suggest a drug that will relieve the symptoms but

263
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,980
