264
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:32,880
If an adverse reaction to a drug is serious, consult your doctor for advice at once.

265
00:23:34,280 --> 00:23:39,220
Drugs that are safe in the dosage stated on the label may be very dangerous in large

266
00:23:39,220 --> 00:23:46,060
doses. example, aspirin is seldom thought of as dangerous, but there are many

267
00:23:46,060 --> 00:23:51,880
